- Auth is **fully implemented** backend-side: `POST /api/auth/login|refresh|logout`, tokens delivered in JSON body only (no cookies, no CSRF concerns), `Authorization: Bearer` header required everywhere except login/refresh. Role → `ROLE_ADMIN`/`ROLE_STUDENT` gating is centralized in `SecurityConfig` exactly as documented.
- **Question/Assignment/Student/StudyRecord/WrongAnswer domains have zero backend code** — spec-only. A peer session `phase01-backend-question` appears to be building the Question domain concurrently.
